Fuel Escalation
3
April 28, 2021
DHP estimates they will consume about 345,000 gallons of off-road diesel fuel throughout the
project. Attachment A summarizes the calculations used to determine the Fuel Adjustment Force
Account value, should the City opt to proceed with Option 2.
A Fuel Force Account pay item could be included as a separated line item to the contract for the
amount of $310,000.
Fuel price escalation adjustments will be paid to the Contractor on a
monthly basis based on the calculation described above.
